Feature: news
  As a logged-in user
  I need to be able to create news
  I need to be able to view news depending on the permissions

Scenario: Create a news item visible to all
  When  I wipe the slate clean
  Then  I go to homepage
  And   log in as "alaress" with password "alaress"
  When  I go to "/news/modify"
  Then  I should see "This is the main portion of your news."
  Then  I fill in "heading" with "Show to all users on every campus"
  And   I fill in wysiwyg "body" with "This article is for all users."
  And   I select "4" from "item_topic_id"
  And   I check "Administration"
  And   I check "Teachers"
  And   I check "Senior Students"
  And   I check "Parents"
  And   I check "Junior Students"
  And   I check "campus[]"
  And   I fill in "item_datetime_expires" with "01/01/2050"
  And   I press "Add News"
  Then  I should see "Show to all users on every campus"
  And   I should see "This article is for all users."

Scenario: Create a news item visible to teachers only
  When  I go to "/logout.php"
  Then  I go to homepage
  And   log in as "alaress" with password "alaress"
  When  I go to "/news/modify"
  Then  I should see "This is the main portion of your news."
  Then  I fill in "heading" with "Show to teacher users on every campus"
  And   I fill in wysiwyg "body" with "This article is for teachers only."
  And   I select "3" from "item_topic_id"
  And   I uncheck "Administration"
  And   I check "Teachers"
  And   I uncheck "Senior Students"
  And   I uncheck "Parents"
  And   I uncheck "Junior Students"
  And   I check "campus[]"
  And   I fill in "item_datetime_expires" with "01/01/2050"
  And   I press "Add News"
  Then  I should see "Show to teacher users on every campus"
  And   I should see "This article is for teachers only."

